{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_4509622E","title":"Harmonizing","entry":"Dlg_4509622E::entry","exit":"Dlg_4509622E::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_65035921","articyId":"72057778721530980","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Hey there! How's life treatin' yah?","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey there! How's life treatin' yah?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17895","byteOffset":14658696,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_A0A0408D","articyId":"72057778721531008","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Oh, that's nice! I've been there once or twice. It's quite the place if you have the right perspective. It's all about mindset, you know?","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, that's nice! I've been there once or twice. It's quite the place if you have the right perspective. It's all about mindset, you know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43688","byteOffset":30856960,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_1C621C58","articyId":"72057778721531016","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Dog bones? Chicken bones? Funny bones? Are you just looking for a calcium boost? I have Bone Broth Brews. Probably would do it.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Dog bones? Chicken bones? Funny bones? Are you just looking for a calcium boost? I have Bone Broth Brews. Probably would do it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43242","byteOffset":30687752,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_E06CA769","articyId":"72057778721531058","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Tell yah what, you let me know what kinda bone you're looking for and why, and I'll have one with you. You seem like you'd be fun when you're lubricated.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tell yah what, you let me know what kinda bone you're looking for and why, and I'll have one with you. You seem like you'd be fun when you're lubricated.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":1150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50736","byteOffset":33534504,"byteLength":548}},{"id":"DFr_DA43A638","articyId":"72057778721531075","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Hey, don't gawk at me. You're the one coming in here talking about buying bones like an appendage harvester in need of a paycheck. So why you looking for a slice of skeleton?","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, don't gawk at me. You're the one coming in here talking about buying bones like an appendage harvester in need of a paycheck. So why you looking for a slice of skeleton?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":1175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47954","byteOffset":32479016,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_B36F7973","articyId":"72057778721531084","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Like Comms parts? Did you have a career change or just indulging a wayward hobby?","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Like Comms parts? Did you have a career change or just indulging a wayward hobby?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24680","byteOffset":17214208,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_6FD3CA5F","articyId":"72057778721531091","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Riiightt. Have you checked with the harvesters in the wastes? Or, I don't know, hang around the Vents long enough and someone's bound to melt their skin off something.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Riiightt. Have you checked with the harvesters in the wastes? Or, I don't know, hang around the Vents long enough and someone's bound to melt their skin off something.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27909","byteOffset":18439720,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_6A409D0B","articyId":"72057778721531113","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"So you ever hear the thing about the company you keep? Says a lot about a person, you know?","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you ever hear the thing about the company you keep? Says a lot about a person, you know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36934","byteOffset":28317176,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_984AB530","articyId":"72057778721531143","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Good point! And I am pretty awesome so that should help your stock somewhat.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good point! And I am pretty awesome so that should help your stock somewhat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":1000.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37492","byteOffset":28521752,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_CD9C18B6","articyId":"72057778721531163","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Look, I might have them, but I can't really sell them.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I might have them, but I can't really sell them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40252","byteOffset":29559336,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_F289F9C0","articyId":"72057778721531186","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Ew, no! I mean, fragments make great hair pins in a pinch--don't ask me how I know that--but they're not for me.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ew, no! I mean, fragments make great hair pins in a pinch--don't ask me how I know that--but they're not for me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4524.0,"y":1000.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51895","byteOffset":34048240,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_65C4F8CD","articyId":"72057778721531193","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harmony","text":"Cannibal Clause in the Intercity Free Trade and Commerce Agreement.","speakerId":"Ntt_9493E357","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Cannibal Clause in 